[Unit]
Description=Wathefni Shifts Wave 2 lifecycle reconciliation timer (DISABLED BY DEFAULT — synthetic-only)
Documentation=file:///opt/wathefni/orchestrator/ops/runbooks/shifts-wave2b-operator-jobs.md

[Timer]
